    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/ea63b9066e7df5f8186d5e82e0bca584.webp?t=1749152852\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/f9c6be7fdcc65f6cce99744cf37b2cf3.poster.avif?t=1749152852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/f9c6be7fdcc65f6cce99744cf37b2cf3.webm?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/f9c6be7fdcc65f6cce99744cf37b2cf3.mp4?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Nice soft visual style, soothing lofi soundtrack, Furry Goddess, mysterious plot and funny dialogues. The most relaxing educational game for immersion in Greek mythology.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship of the Greek hero Odysseus is approaching the mysterious island after many months of wandering at sea. Unexplored forests and temple ruins hold mystical secrets. Odysseus' crew is greeted on the shore by the attractive pig girl Circe. This is where the plot of <strong>Furry Myth \ud83e\udd81</strong> begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/1c03ead88aad34accd4e4155c5a63c58.poster.avif?t=1749152852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/1c03ead88aad34accd4e4155c5a63c58.webm?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/1c03ead88aad34accd4e4155c5a63c58.mp4?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This visual novel with elements of match3 is created for your comfort and relaxation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where ancient legends merge with furries, where gods and heroes find new forms, and where your actions shape the destiny of both realms. Embark on an unforgettable adventure in <strong>Furry Myth \ud83e\udd81</strong> a visual novel that will captivate your imagination and leave a lasting impact on your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a vibrant world where gods, goddesses, and furry heroes come alive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chiil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Furry Goddess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PIG!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60+ levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 Lovely Furry Girls </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 in a row</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/ea63b9066e7df5f8186d5e82e0bca584.webp?t=1749152852\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/f9c6be7fdcc65f6cce99744cf37b2cf3.poster.avif?t=1749152852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/f9c6be7fdcc65f6cce99744cf37b2cf3.webm?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/f9c6be7fdcc65f6cce99744cf37b2cf3.mp4?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Nice soft visual style, soothing lofi soundtrack, Furry Goddess, mysterious plot and funny dialogues. The most relaxing educational game for immersion in Greek mythology.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship of the Greek hero Odysseus is approaching the mysterious island after many months of wandering at sea. Unexplored forests and temple ruins hold mystical secrets. Odysseus' crew is greeted on the shore by the attractive pig girl Circe. This is where the plot of <strong>Furry Myth \ud83e\udd81</strong> begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/1c03ead88aad34accd4e4155c5a63c58.poster.avif?t=1749152852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/1c03ead88aad34accd4e4155c5a63c58.webm?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451640/extras/1c03ead88aad34accd4e4155c5a63c58.mp4?t=1749152852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This visual novel with elements of match3 is created for your comfort and relaxation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where ancient legends merge with furries, where gods and heroes find new forms, and where your actions shape the destiny of both realms. Embark on an unforgettable adventure in <strong>Furry Myth \ud83e\udd81</strong> a visual novel that will captivate your imagination and leave a lasting impact on your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a vibrant world where gods, goddesses, and furry heroes come alive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chiil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Furry Goddess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PIG!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60+ levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 Lovely Furry Girls </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 in a row</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The most relaxing educational game for immersion in Greek mythology. Furry Myth \ud83e\udd81 is about amazing myths of ancient Greece and charming furry characters! Chill Lofi soundtrack, relaxing gameplay and cuddly Greek Furry Goddesses. This is where the time for recreation and enjoyment begins.",
